# Ctrl+A then dd in Upcoming deletes every listed block with its children, and z brings them all back.
file <<END
Keep:
	- Stay
	- Parent @due({today+2})
		- Child undated
		- Child dated @due({today+1})
	- Over @due({today-1})
END
keys gU
see Child dated
keys <C-a> dd
saved <<END
Keep:
	- Stay
	- Over @due({today-1})
END
keys z
see ▌ - Child dated
quit
saved <<END
Keep:
	- Stay
	- Parent @due({today+2})
		- Child undated
		- Child dated @due({today+1})
	- Over @due({today-1})
END
